<content>
<procedure>
<preliminaryRqmts>
<reqCondGroup><reqCondNoRef><reqCond>The fan assembly is installed and the access panel is closed.</reqCond></reqCondNoRef></reqCondGroup>
<reqSupportEquips><supportEquipDescrGroup><supportEquipDescr id="seq-0001"><name>Bench power supply, 24 V DC</name><identNumber><manufacturerCode>0DEMO</manufacturerCode><partAndSerialNumber><partNumber>ARF-GSE-01</partNumber></partAndSerialNumber></identNumber><reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity></supportEquipDescr></supportEquipDescrGroup></reqSupportEquips>
<reqSupplies><noSupplies/></reqSupplies>
<reqSpares><noSpares/></reqSpares>
<reqSafety><safetyRqmts><warning><warningAndCautionPara>Keep the access panel closed when the fan operates. The fan blades can turn and cause injury to your fingers.</warningAndCautionPara></warning></safetyRqmts></reqSafety>
</preliminaryRqmts>
<mainProcedure>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0001"><para>Start the rig. Refer to <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="ARFRIG" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="00" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="131" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>Training rig</techName><infoName>Normal operation procedure</infoName></dmTitle></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef>.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0002"><para>If the fan does not run, do the fault isolation procedure. Refer to <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="ARFRIG" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="20" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="421" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>Fan does not run</techName><infoName>Fault isolation procedure</infoName></dmTitle></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef>.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0003"><para>Set the speed control R1 to MIN. Make sure that the results agree with <internalRef internalRefId="tab-0001" internalRefTargetType="irtt02"/>.</para><table id="tab-0001"><title>Fan assembly - function test results</title>
<tgroup cols="3"><colspec colname="col1"/><colspec colname="col2"/><colspec colname="col3"/>
<thead><row><entry><para>Speed control R1</para></entry><entry><para>Airflow indicator</para></entry><entry><para>FAN FAULT lamp DS2</para></entry></row></thead>
<tbody>
<row><entry><para>MIN</para></entry><entry><para>Pointer in the white band</para></entry><entry><para>Off</para></entry></row>
<row><entry><para>MAX</para></entry><entry><para>Pointer in the green band</para></entry><entry><para>Off</para></entry></row>
</tbody></tgroup></table></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0004"><para>Set the speed control R1 to MAX.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0005"><para>Make sure that the pointer of the airflow indicator is in the green band.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0006"><para>Listen to the fan assembly for 30 seconds.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0007"><note><notePara>A smooth, even sound is normal.</notePara></note><para>If you hear a noise from the fan bearing, replace the fan assembly. Refer to <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="ARFRIG" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="20" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="520" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>Fan assembly</techName><infoName>Remove procedure</infoName></dmTitle></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef> and <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="ARFRIG" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="20" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="720" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>Fan assembly</techName><infoName>Install procedure</infoName></dmTitle></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef>.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0008"><para>If the pointer is not in the green band, adjust the fan speed. Refer to <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="ARFRIG" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="20" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="271" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>Fan speed</techName><infoName>Adjust</infoName></dmTitle></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef>.</para></proceduralStep>
<proceduralStep id="stp-0009"><para>Stop the rig.</para></proceduralStep>
</mainProcedure>
<closeRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup></closeRqmts>
</procedure>
